ecchi amori e nuove gioie. Perché è proprio quando credi di aver visto tutto che scopri quanto la vita riesca ancora a sorprenderti."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Last Week of September","overview":"Pietro Rinaldi, an elderly writer, widower and tired of life, plans to commit suicide on his birthday. After the sudden and tragic death of his daughter and son-in-law, Pietro will have to look after his teenage nephew Mattia."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ruaD8GiwNnuH6XBvhzqYyXruYiT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ruaD8GiwNnuH6XBvhzqYyXruYiT.png","language":"it","width":992,"height":207}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJgiwCkMgycIldUjnx19cc4AnHs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hJgiwCkMgycIldUjnx19cc4AnHs.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6nl4Hd3cT584yS4Lrsh3ksoOJl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g6nl4Hd3cT584yS4Lrsh3ksoOJl.jpg","language":"it","width":630,"height":945},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8oAxcQ1q5zFeRq8z9bb1Rzs0asI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8oAxcQ1q5zFeRq8z9bb1Rzs0asI.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CTXaejQn3gmq0ap8yW4HO1iMeP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/CTXaejQn3gmq0ap8yW4HO1iMeP.jpg","language":"xx","width":2560,"height":1440},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hOF6Vag3LredKTg1X9iDCsvMHGY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hOF6Vag3LredKTg1X9iDCsvMHGY.jpg","language":"xx","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ruaD8GiwNnuH6XBvhzqYyXruYiT.png","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJgiwCkMgycIldUjnx19cc4AnHs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CTXaejQn3gmq0ap8yW4HO